{
  "run_id": "PMC10920630__scimon__multi_decision_ground_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A nanocrystalline refractory high-entropy-alloy thin film can create a robust passivating surface on stainless steel.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Such a coating can significantly improve stainless-steel corrosion resistance in extreme environments.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9",
        "PMC9955357::chunk::000::abstract::094b212c37"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The native passive oxide layer on stainless steel is ineffective under extreme corrosion conditions.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9955357::chunk::000::abstract::094b212c37"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is deposition of a nanocrystalline refractory high-entropy-alloy film on stainless steel.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A data-driven or machine-learning model can optimize the coating-deposition parameters.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature molten salts are extreme environments in which conventional stainless-steel passivation can fail.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9955357::chunk::000::abstract::094b212c37"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aggressive oxidizing conditions can cause conventional stainless-steel passivation to fail.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention forms a dense, refined nanocrystalline passivating layer containing protective phases.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized deposition process forms a strongly adherent oxide layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting oxide layer is self-healing.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating impedes corrosive attack by acting as a diffusion barrier.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated stainless steel will have a markedly lower corrosion rate than untreated stainless steel under the same extreme conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9955357::chunk::000::abstract::094b212c37"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will improve stainless-steel durability under extreme corrosion conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9955357::chunk::000::abstract::094b212c37"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant control is stainless steel retaining its native oxide layer and exposed to the same severe environment.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Effectiveness depends on the validity of the predictive model and on remaining within a suitable deposition-process window.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coating performance may differ under less aggressive conditions.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Existing trends in advanced coating techniques support the proposed mechanism.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A lack of statistically significant corrosion improvement relative to an uncoated control would falsify the hypothesis.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
